# @NAME@ for Gamebuino META

Generated by `gbrecomp --target meta`. Workflow, tests and limitations are
documented in `targets/meta/README.md` of the gb-recompiled repository.

```bash
# Firmware (check the RAM/Flash report)
pio run
pio run -t upload            # or copy .pio/build/meta/firmware.bin to the SD card

# Host tools
cmake -G Ninja -S host -B host/build && ninja -C host/build
host/build/@NAME@_play --interp --coverage more.cov --record-input more.input
host/build/@NAME@_host --interp --frames 3000 --input more.input   # reference
host/build/@NAME@_host --frames 3000 --input more.input            # META build
```

Regenerate with every coverage file in `coverage/` plus new ones, e.g.
`gbrecomp game.gb --target meta --coverage coverage/a.cov --coverage more.cov -o <this dir>`.

META controls: D-pad, A, B; MENU = Start; HOME tap = Select; HOME held half
a second opens the option menu (display mode, palette, frame skip, 48/72 MHz,
back to the Gamebuino loader). The menu shows the emulated and drawn frames
of the last second.
